# Task VIII: Database Relationship Analysis Using Joins

## 1. Project Overview

This project demonstrates database relationship analysis using SQL joins in an E-Commerce Database Management System.

The project combines four tables: Customer, Product, Orders, and Payment. It implements INNER JOIN, LEFT JOIN, and RIGHT JOIN to retrieve complete order details, display customer purchase history, and generate multi-table reports.

## 2. Objectives

* Combine Customer, Product, Orders, and Payment tables.
* Implement INNER JOIN, LEFT JOIN, and RIGHT JOIN.
* Retrieve complete order details.
* Display customer purchase history.
* Generate multi-table reports.
* Identify orders without payment records.
* Analyze customer purchases, product sales, and payment methods.

