## 9. INNER JOIN Implementation

INNER JOIN returns only records with matching values in the joined tables.

### 9.1 Customer and Orders

```sql
SELECT
    Customer.customer_name,
    Orders.order_id,
    Orders.order_date,
    Orders.status
FROM Customer
INNER JOIN Orders
    ON Customer.customer_id = Orders.customer_id;
```

### 9.2 Orders and Products

```sql
SELECT
    Orders.order_id,
    Product.product_name,
    Product.category,
    Orders.quantity,
    Product.price
FROM Orders
INNER JOIN Product
    ON Orders.product_id = Product.product_id;
```

### 9.3 Combine All Four Tables

```sql
SELECT
    Customer.customer_name,
    Customer.city,
    Orders.order_id,
    Orders.order_date,
    Product.product_name,
    Product.category,
    Orders.quantity,
    Product.price,
    (Orders.quantity * Product.price) AS subtotal,
    Payment.payment_mode,
    Payment.amount,
    Payment.payment_status
FROM Customer
INNER JOIN Orders
    ON Customer.customer_id = Orders.customer_id
INNER JOIN Product
    ON Orders.product_id = Product.product_id
INNER JOIN Payment
    ON Orders.order_id = Payment.order_id;
```

## 10. LEFT JOIN Implementation

LEFT JOIN returns all records from the left table and matching records from the right table. Missing matches are represented by NULL.

### 10.1 Display All Customers and Their Orders

```sql
SELECT
    Customer.customer_id,
    Customer.customer_name,
    Orders.order_id,
    Orders.order_date,
    Orders.status
FROM Customer
LEFT JOIN Orders
    ON Customer.customer_id = Orders.customer_id;
```

### 10.2 Display All Orders and Payment Details

```sql
SELECT
    Orders.order_id,
    Orders.order_date,
    Orders.status,
    Payment.payment_mode,
    Payment.amount,
    Payment.payment_status
FROM Orders
LEFT JOIN Payment
    ON Orders.order_id = Payment.order_id;
```

## 11. RIGHT JOIN Implementation

RIGHT JOIN returns all records from the right table and matching records from the left table.

### 11.1 Display All Products and Their Orders

```sql
SELECT
    Orders.order_id,
    Orders.order_date,
    Product.product_id,
    Product.product_name,
    Product.price
FROM Orders
RIGHT JOIN Product
    ON Orders.product_id = Product.product_id;
```

### 11.2 Display All Payments and Order Details

```sql
SELECT
    Payment.payment_id,
    Payment.payment_mode,
    Payment.amount,
    Payment.payment_status,
    Orders.order_id,
    Orders.order_date
FROM Orders
RIGHT JOIN Payment
    ON Orders.order_id = Payment.order_id;
```

## 12. Retrieve Complete Order Details

This query combines customer, order, product, and payment information.

```sql
SELECT
    Orders.order_id,
    Customer.customer_name,
    Customer.city,
    Product.product_name,
    Product.category,
    Orders.order_date,
    Orders.quantity,
    Product.price,
    (Orders.quantity * Product.price) AS subtotal,
    Orders.status AS order_status,
    Payment.payment_mode,
    Payment.payment_status
FROM Orders
INNER JOIN Customer
    ON Orders.customer_id = Customer.customer_id
INNER JOIN Product
    ON Orders.product_id = Product.product_id
LEFT JOIN Payment
    ON Orders.order_id = Payment.order_id
ORDER BY Orders.order_date;
```

