## 14. Multi-Table Reports

### 14.1 Total Purchase Value for Each Customer

```sql
SELECT
    Customer.customer_name,
    SUM(Orders.quantity * Product.price) AS total_purchase_value
FROM Customer
INNER JOIN Orders
    ON Customer.customer_id = Orders.customer_id
INNER JOIN Product
    ON Orders.product_id = Product.product_id
GROUP BY Customer.customer_id, Customer.customer_name
ORDER BY total_purchase_value DESC;
```

### 14.2 Total Sales for Each Product

```sql
SELECT
    Product.product_name,
    SUM(Orders.quantity) AS total_quantity_sold,
    SUM(Orders.quantity * Product.price) AS total_sales
FROM Product
INNER JOIN Orders
    ON Product.product_id = Orders.product_id
GROUP BY Product.product_id, Product.product_name
ORDER BY total_sales DESC;
```

### 14.3 Analyze Payment Methods

```sql
SELECT
    Payment.payment_mode,
    COUNT(Payment.payment_id) AS total_transactions,
    SUM(Payment.amount) AS total_payment_amount
FROM Payment
WHERE Payment.payment_status = 'Successful'
GROUP BY Payment.payment_mode
ORDER BY total_payment_amount DESC;
```

### 14.4 Find Orders Without Payment Records

```sql
SELECT
    Orders.order_id,
    Customer.customer_name,
    Orders.order_date,
    Orders.status
FROM Orders
INNER JOIN Customer
    ON Orders.customer_id = Customer.customer_id
LEFT JOIN Payment
    ON Orders.order_id = Payment.order_id
WHERE Payment.payment_id IS NULL;
```

### 14.5 Count Orders for Each Customer

```sql
SELECT
    Customer.customer_name,
    COUNT(Orders.order_id) AS total_orders
FROM Customer
LEFT JOIN Orders
    ON Customer.customer_id = Orders.customer_id
GROUP BY Customer.customer_id, Customer.customer_name
ORDER BY total_orders DESC;
```

