## 16. Database Relationships

The database uses primary keys and foreign keys to connect the four tables.

* `Customer.customer_id` connects Customer with Orders.
* `Product.product_id` connects Product with Orders.
* `Orders.order_id` connects Orders with Payment.

### Relationship Diagram

```text
Customer
   |
   | customer_id
   |
   v
Orders -------- Product
   |
   | order_id
   |
   v
Payment
```

